<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ns1="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">Pambuka Wilangan Cacah</title><metadata xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
  <ns1:content-id>m81243</ns1:content-id>
  <ns1:title>Pambuka Wilangan Cacah</ns1:title>
  <ns1:abstract><para id="para-00001">Sawise ngrampungake bagean iki, sampeyan bakal bisa:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
<item>Ngenali wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah</item>
<item>Nggambarake wilangan cacah nganggo model</item>
<item>Ngenali nilai panggonan sawijining digit</item>
<item>Nggunakake nilai panggonan kanggo nyebut wilangan cacah</item>
<item>Nggunakake nilai panggonan kanggo nulis wilangan cacah</item>
<item>Mbunderake wilangan cacah</item>
</list></ns1:abstract>
  <ns1:uuid>7cbc90c7-60c8-4211-bffe-b77aadc95509</ns1:uuid>
</metadata><content>
<section id="fs-id1830385" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ngenali Wilangan Asli lan Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id2325869">Sinau aljabar padha karo sinau basa. Sinau diwiwiti saka tetembungan dhasar, banjur ditambahi sithik mbaka sithik. Latihan kudu ditindakake kanthi kerep nganti tetembungan kasebut gampang dimangerteni. Saya kerep digunakake, saya kulina anggone nggunakake tetembungan kasebut.</para>
<para id="fs-id2269442">Aljabar nggunakake wilangan lan simbol kanggo mratelakake tembung lan gagasan. Ayo diwiwiti saka wilangan. Wilangan paling dhasar ing aljabar yaiku wilangan sing digunakake kanggo ngetung barang: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>…</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan sateruse. Wilangan-wilangan iki diarani <term id="term-00001">wilangan asli</term>. Notasi “…” diarani elipsis; notasi iki mratelakake “lan sateruse”, utawa nuduhake yen pola kasebut terus tanpa wates. Wilangan kanggo ngetung uga diarani wilangan natural.</para>
<note id="fs-id2631065">
<title>Wilangan Asli</title>
<para id="fs-id1565524">Wilangan asli diwiwiti saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan terus sateruse.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1601874" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>5…</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></note>
<para id="fs-id2741297">Wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah bisa digambarake ing <term id="term-00002">garis wilangan</term>, kaya sing dituduhake ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001" />.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001"><media id="fs-id2316516" alt="Gambar garis wilangan saka 0 nganti 6 kanthi mundhak siji-siji. Panah ing ndhuwur garis wilangan tumuju nengen lan diwenehi label “luwih gedhé”. Panah sing tumuju ngiwa diwenehi label “luwih cilik”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_001.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>

<caption>Wilangan ing garis wilangan saya gedhé saka kiwa menyang tengen lan saya cilik saka tengen menyang kiwa.</caption></figure><para id="fs-id1410425">Titik kanthi label <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> diarani <term id="term-00003">titik asal</term>. Titik-titik ing sisih tengen <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> nduweni jarak sing padha lan diwenehi label wilangan asli. Yen sawijining wilangan dipasangake karo sawijining titik, wilangan kasebut diarani <term id="term-00004">koordinat</term> titik kasebut.</para>
<para id="fs-id1383646">Panemune wilangan nol dadi langkah gedhé ing sejarah matematika. Yen nol dilebokake bebarengan karo wilangan asli, bakal kawangun himpunan wilangan anyar sing diarani <term id="term-00005">wilangan cacah</term>.</para>
<note id="fs-id2606982">
<title>Wilangan Cacah</title>
<para id="fs-id1516323">Wilangan cacah yaiku wilangan asli bebarengan karo nol.</para>
<equation id="fs-id2260967" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>5…</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></equation></note>
<para id="fs-id1904853">Dhaptar iki dipungkasi ing <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> nalika nulis sawetara <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">wilangan asli</term> lan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">wilangan cacah</term> sing wiwitan. Wilangan liyane bisa ditulis yen perlu kanggo njlentrehake polane.</para>
<example id="fs-id1262372">
<exercise id="fs-id1398237"><problem id="fs-id3413579">
<para id="fs-id1393222">Saka wilangan ing ngisor iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli? <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id1269630"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5.2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2564359">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<list id="fs-id2198081" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Wilangan asli diwiwiti saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> mula <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> dudu wilangan asli. Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kabeh kalebu wilangan asli.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Wilangan cacah yaiku wilangan asli bebarengan karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalebu wilangan cacah.</item></list><para id="fs-id1952631">Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5.2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ora kalebu wilangan asli utawa wilangan cacah. Wilangan-wilangan iki bakal dirembug mengko.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2698269" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id3298473"><problem id="fs-id2210740">
<para id="fs-id1587799">Saka wilangan ing ngisor iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id1363233"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>11.8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>241</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>376</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2775154">
<list id="fs-id2425678" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 2, 9, 241, 376</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 2, 9, 241, 376</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1906330" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1786026"><problem id="fs-id2812320">
<para id="fs-id1409646">Saka wilangan ing ngisor iki, endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah?</para><para id="fs-id2840506"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>8.8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>201</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1415724">
<list id="fs-id1960220" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 7, 13, 201</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 7, 13, 201</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
</section><section id="fs-id2340048" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Model Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id1862565">Sistem wilangan sing digunakake diarani <term id="term-00008">sistem nilai panggonan</term> amarga nilai sawijining digit gumantung marang posisi, utawa panggonan, digit kasebut ing sawijining wilangan. Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>537</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nduweni nilai sing beda karo wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>735</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Sanajan digit sing digunakake padha, nilaine beda amarga panggonan digit <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> beda.</para><para id="fs-id1461000">Dhuwit bisa dadi model nilai panggonan sing wis dikenal. Upamane sawijining dompet isi telung lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$100</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, pitung lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, lan patang lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$1</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Cacahe diringkes ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002" />. Pira gunggung dhuwit ing dompet kasebut?</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002"><media id="fs-id1302206" alt="Gambar telung tumpukan dhuwit kertas Amerika Serikat. Saka kiwa menyang tengen: telung lembar dhuwit $100 kanthi label “Telung lembar dhuwit $100; 3 ping $100 padha karo $300”; pitung lembar dhuwit $10 kanthi label “Pitung lembar dhuwit $10; 7 ping $10 padha karo $70”; lan patang lembar dhuwit $1 kanthi label “Patang lembar dhuwit $1; 4 ping $1 padha karo $4”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><para id="fs-id2243766">Temtokake nilai total saben jinis dhuwit kertas, banjur tambahake kabeh kanggo nemtokake gunggungane. Dompet kasebut isi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$374</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<media id="fs-id2438560" alt="Gambar ekspresi “$300 + $70 + $4”. Digit 3 ing $300, digit 7 ing $70, lan digit 4 ing $4 wernane abang, dene bagean liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana nilai $374. Panah nyambungake saben digit abang ing ekspresi karo digit sing cocog ing $374.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_003_img.jpg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id865961">Blok basis-10 menehi cara liya kanggo nggawe model nilai panggonan, kaya sing dituduhake ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004" />. Blok-blok iki bisa digunakake kanggo makili atusan, puluhan, lan satuan. Gatekna yen batang puluhan kasusun saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan, dene persegi atusan kasusun saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> puluhan, utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004"><media id="fs-id2294051" alt="Gambar telung wujud blok basis-10. Wujud kapisan yaiku siji blok kanthi label “Siji blok makili 1”. Wujud kapindho yaiku batang mendatar sing kasusun saka 10 blok kanthi label “Siji batang makili 10”. Wujud katelu yaiku persegi ukuran 10 ping 10 blok kanthi label “Siji persegi makili 100”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><para id="fs-id2860981"><link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005" /> nuduhake wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>138</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> sing dimodelake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005"><media id="fs-id1823977" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing kasusun saka siji persegi atusan ukuran 10 ping 10 blok kanthi label “1 atusan”, telung batang puluhan kanthi label “3 puluhan”, lan wolung blok satuan kanthi label “8 satuan”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>

<caption>Notasi nilai panggonan digunakake kanggo nuduhake nilai wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>138</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><media id="fs-id2387933" alt="Gambar ekspresi “100 + 30 + 8”. Digit 1 ing 100, digit 3 ing 30, lan digit 8 wernane abang, dene bagean liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana wilangan 138. Panah nyambungake saben digit abang ing ekspresi karo digit sing cocog ing wilangan 138.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_006_img.jpg" />
</media>
<table id="fs-id1714120" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel nilai panggonan kanthi 5 kolom lan 5 larik. Larik irah-irahan ngemot Digit, Nilai panggonan, Wilangan, Nilai, lan Nilai total. Telung larik sabanjure ngandharake 138: digit 1 ana ing panggonan atusan lan nilaine 100; digit 3 ana ing panggonan puluhan lan nilaine 30; digit 8 ana ing panggonan satuan lan nilaine 8. Larik pungkasan nuduhake gunggung 138."><label />
<tgroup cols="5"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
