</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><example id="fs-id2222880">
<exercise id="fs-id2908692"><problem id="fs-id2206322">
<para id="fs-id2939641">Gunakake notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing dimodelake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> sing ditampilake.</para>
<media id="fs-id2482064" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing kasusun saka rong persegi atusan, siji batang puluhan, lan limang blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_007_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1806167">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1249764">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> persegi atusan, sing nduweni nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>200</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1348273">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> batang puluhan, sing nduweni nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id3302675">Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok satuan, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
<media id="fs-id2164193" alt="Gambar ekspresi “200 + 10 + 5”. Digit 2 ing 200, digit 1 ing 10, lan digit 5 wernane abang, dene bagean liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana wilangan 215. Panah nyambungake saben digit abang ing ekspresi karo digit sing cocog ing wilangan 215.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_008_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
<table id="fs-id1785447" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel nilai panggonan kanthi 5 kolom lan 5 larik. Larik irah-irahan ngemot Digit, Nilai panggonan, Wilangan, Nilai, lan Nilai total. Telung larik sabanjure ngandharake 215: digit 2 ana ing panggonan atusan lan nilaine 200; digit 1 ana ing panggonan puluhan lan nilaine 10; digit 5 ana ing panggonan satuan lan nilaine 5. Larik pungkasan nuduhake asil 215."><label />
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center">Digit</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai panggonan</entry>
<entry align="center">Wilangan</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai</entry>
<entry align="right">Nilai total</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">atusan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>200</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">puluhan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">satuan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry /><entry /><entry /><entry /><entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1381620">Blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> kasebut dadi model wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id835824" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1227376"><problem id="fs-id2652455">
<para id="fs-id2784412">Gunakake notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing dimodelake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> sing ditampilake.</para>
<media id="fs-id4224006" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing kasusun saka siji persegi atusan, pitung batang puluhan, lan nem blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_009_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2609767">
<para id="fs-id2851234">176</para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id2269666" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1983295"><problem id="fs-id1728004">
<para id="fs-id2111126">Gunakake notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing dimodelake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> sing ditampilake.</para>
<media id="fs-id1841537" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing kasusun saka rong persegi atusan, telung batang puluhan, lan pitung blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_010_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2136425">
<para id="fs-id1829429">237</para>
</solution>
</exercise></note><note id="eip-id1168898089706" class="manipulative-math">Kagiyatan Matematika Manipulatif Garis Wilangan—Bagean 1 bakal mbantu anggone mangerteni wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah kanthi luwih becik.</note>
</section><section id="fs-id1883656" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Ngenali Nilai Panggonan Sawijining Digit</title>
<para id="fs-id1795155">Saka dhuwit lan blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, bisa dideleng yen saben panggonan ing sawijining wilangan nduweni nilai sing beda. Tabel nilai panggonan migunani kanggo ngringkes katrangan iki. Nilai panggonan diperang dadi klompok-klompok isi telung panggonan sing diarani periode. <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00009">Periode</term> kasebut yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">satuan, éwuan, yutanan, milyaran, trilyunan</emphasis>, lan sateruse. Ing wilangan sing katulis, tandha koma misahake saben periode.</para><para id="fs-id2825467">Kaya ing blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, nilai batang puluhan yaiku sepuluh ping nilai blok satuan, lan nilai persegi atusan yaiku sepuluh ping nilai batang puluhan. Semono uga, nilai saben panggonan ing tabel nilai panggonan yaiku sepuluh ping nilai panggonan ing sisih tengene.</para>
<para id="fs-id1408851"><link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_011" /> nuduhake carane wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5,278,194</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis ing tabel nilai panggonan.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_011"><media id="fs-id1339846" alt="Bagan kanthi irah-irahan 'Nilai Panggonan', isine limalas kolom lan 4 larik. Kolom-kolom kasebut diperang dadi limang klompok, saben klompok isi telung kolom. Larik irah-irahan nuduhake Trilyun, Milyar, Yuta, Éwuan, lan Satuan. Larik sabanjure ngemot 'Atusan trilyun', 'Sepuluh trilyun', 'trilyun', 'Atusan milyar', 'Sepuluh milyar', 'milyar', 'Satus yuta', 'Sepuluh yuta', 'yutanan', 'Satus éwu', 'Sepuluh éwu', 'éwuan', 'atusan', 'puluhan', lan 'satuan'. 8 nilai kapisan ing larik sabanjure kosong. Wiwit kolom kaping sanga, nilaine yaiku '5', '2', '7', '8', '1', '9', lan '4'.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_011.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><list id="fs-id930962" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan yutanan. Nilaine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5,000,000</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan atusan éwu. Nilaine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>200,000</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan puluhan éwu. Nilaine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70,000</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan éwuan. Nilaine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8,000</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan atusan. Nilaine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan puluhan. Nilaine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>90</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item>Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan satuan. Nilaine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
</list>
<example id="fs-id1891091">
<exercise id="fs-id1256900"><problem id="fs-id1581177">
<para id="fs-id1738612">Ing wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>63,407,218</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> temtokake nilai panggonan saben digit ing ngisor iki:</para>
<list id="fs-id2218367" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item><item> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math></item><item> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> </item><item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math> </item><item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2851093">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id2281077">Tulisen wilangan kasebut ing tabel nilai panggonan, diwiwiti saka tengen.<newline />
<media id="fs-id2297687" alt="Gambar kanthi irah-irahan “Nilai Panggonan”, isine limalas kolom lan 2 larik. Kolome diperang dadi limang klompok, saben klompok isi telung kolom. Larik kapisan ngemot “Atusan trilyun”, “Sepuluh trilyun”, “trilyun”, “Atusan milyar”, “Sepuluh milyar”, “milyar”, “Satus yuta”, “Sepuluh yuta”, “yutanan”, “Satus éwu”, “Sepuluh éwu”, “éwuan”, “atusan”, “puluhan”, lan “satuan”. 7 nilai kapisan ing larik kapindho kosong. Wiwit kolom kaping wolu, nilaine yaiku “6”, “3”, “4”, “0”, “7”, “2”, “1” lan “8”. Klompok kapisan dilabeli “trilyun” lan ngemot “Atusan trilyun”, “Sepuluh trilyun”, lan “trilyun”. Klompok kapindho dilabeli “milyar” lan ngemot “Atusan milyar”, “Sepuluh milyar”, lan “milyar”. Klompok katelu dilabeli “yutanan” lan ngemot “Atusan yuta”, “Sepuluh yuta”, lan “yutanan”. Klompok kapapat dilabeli “éwuan” lan ngemot “Atusan éwu”, “Sepuluh éwu”, lan “éwuan”. Klompok kalima dilabeli “satuan” lan ngemot “Atusan”, “puluhan”, lan “satuan”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_012_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para>
<list id="eip-id1168898159450" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> ana ing panggonan éwuan.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> ana ing panggonan puluhan éwu.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan puluhan.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan puluhan yuta.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> Digit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ana ing panggonan yutanan.</item>
</list></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2310429" class="try"><exercise id="fs-id1573052"><problem id="fs-id1607674">
<para id="fs-id1816164">Kanggo wilangan ing ngisor iki, temtokake nilai panggonan saben digit sing kadhaptar: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>27,493,615</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<list id="fs-id1386307" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> <m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math></item>
</list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2903653">
<list id="fs-id1811287" class="circled" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> puluhan yuta</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> puluhan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> atusan éwu</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> yutanan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> satuan</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note><note id="fs-id1282619" class="try"><exercise id="fs-id1518735"><problem id="fs-id3013699">
<para id="fs-id1778628">Kanggo wilangan ing ngisor iki, temtokake nilai panggonan saben digit sing kadhaptar: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>519,711,641,328</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<list id="fs-id1508784" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item>
</list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2619544">
<list id="fs-id1807276" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> milyaran</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> puluhan éwu</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> puluhan</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> atusan éwu</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓔ</span> atusan yuta</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note></section><section id="fs-id1321580" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Nggunakake Nilai Panggonan kanggo Nyebutake Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id2566318">Nalika nulis cek, wilangan ditulis nganggo tembung lan uga digit. Kanggo nulis sawijining wilangan nganggo tembung, tulisen wilangan ing saben periode, banjur jeneng periodene. Wiwitana saka digit paling kiwa, sing nduweni nilai panggonan paling gedhé. Koma misahake periode; mula, saben koma ing wilangan uga ditulis minangka koma ing antarane rerangkening tembung. Periode satuan, sing nduweni nilai panggonan paling cilik, ora disebutake jenenge.</para>
<figure id="eip-id1168289680652" class="unnumbered"><label /><media id="fs-id1227744" alt="Gambar kanthi telung nilai sing dipisah nganggo koma. Nilai kapisan yaiku “37” lan diwenehi label “yutanan”. Nilai kapindho yaiku “519” lan diwenehi label “éwuan”. Nilai katelu yaiku “248” lan diwenehi label “satuan”. Ing ngisore, panah saka “37” nuding menyang “Telung puluh pitu yuta”, panah saka “519” nuding menyang “Limang atus sangalas éwu”, lan panah saka “248” nuding menyang “Rong atus patang puluh wolu”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_013_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></figure><para id="fs-id2220075">Dadi, wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>37,519,248</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis minangka telung puluh pitu yuta, limang atus sangalas éwu, rong atus patang puluh wolu.</para>
<para id="fs-id3400199">Gatekna yen tembung <emphasis effect="italics">lan</emphasis> ora digunakake nalika nyebutake wilangan cacah.</para>
<note id="fs-id1364640" class="howto"><title>Nyebutake wilangan cacah nganggo tembung.</title><list id="eip-375" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Wiwitana saka digit paling kiwa, sebutake wilangan ing saben periode, banjur jeneng periodene. Jeneng periode satuan aja dilebokake.</item>
<item>Gunakna koma ing wilangan kanggo misahake periode.</item></list></note><example id="fs-id2326974"><exercise id="fs-id1545709"><problem id="fs-id882630">
<para id="fs-id1880734">Sebutake wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8,165,432,098,710</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nganggo tembung.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2196744">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="fs-id1171100715908" aria-label="Wiwitana saka digit paling kiwa, yaiku 8. Digit kasebut ana ing panggonan trilyunan: wolung trilyun. / Periode sabanjure ing sisih tengen yaiku milyaran: satus sewidak lima milyar. / Periode sabanjure yaiku yutanan: patang atus telung puluh loro yuta. / Periode sabanjure yaiku éwuan: sangang puluh wolu éwu. / Periode paling tengen yaiku satuan: pitung atus sepuluh." class="unnumbered unstyled">
<tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Wiwitana saka digit paling kiwa, yaiku 8. Digit kasebut ana ing panggonan trilyunan.</entry>
    <entry>wolung trilyun</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Periode sabanjure ing sisih tengen yaiku milyaran.</entry>
    <entry>satus sewidak lima milyar</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Periode sabanjure ing sisih tengen yaiku yutanan.</entry>
    <entry>patang atus telung puluh loro yuta</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Periode sabanjure ing sisih tengen yaiku éwuan.</entry>
    <entry>sangang puluh wolu éwu</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Periode paling tengen nuduhake satuane.</entry>
    <entry>pitung atus sepuluh</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="eip-id1168287499693"><media id="fs-id1209906" alt="Gambar kanthi limang nilai sing dipisah nganggo koma. Nilai kapisan yaiku “8” lan diwenehi label “trilyun”. Nilai kapindho yaiku “165” lan diwenehi label “milyar”. Nilai katelu yaiku “432” lan diwenehi label “yutanan”. Nilai kapapat yaiku “098” lan diwenehi label “éwuan”. Nilai kalima yaiku “710” lan diwenehi label “satuan”. Ing ngisore, saka nilai “8” ana panah menyang “Wolung trilyun”, saka nilai “165” ana panah menyang “Satus sewidak lima milyar”, saka nilai “432” ana panah menyang “Patang atus telung puluh loro yuta”, saka nilai “098” ana panah menyang “Sangang puluh wolu éwu”, lan saka nilai “710” ana panah menyang “pitung atus sepuluh”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_014_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para>
<para id="fs-id1851678">Kanthi ngrangkai kabeh tembung, wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8,165,432,098,710</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis minangka wolung trilyun, satus sewidak lima milyar, patang atus telung puluh loro yuta, sangang puluh wolu éwu, pitung atus sepuluh.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2774887" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2601285">
<problem id="fs-id2353164">
<para id="fs-id2269538">Sebutake wilangan ing ngisor iki nganggo tembung: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9,258,137,904,061</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1312880">
<para id="fs-id1469854">sangang trilyun, rong atus sèket wolu milyar, satus telung puluh pitu yuta, sangang atus papat éwu, sewidak siji</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2136533" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1773572">
<problem id="fs-id2926171">
<para id="fs-id2555667">Sebutake wilangan ing ngisor iki nganggo tembung: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17,864,325,619,004</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1683677">
<para id="fs-id1278691">pitulas trilyun, wolung atus sewidak papat milyar, telung atus salawé yuta, nem atus sangalas éwu, papat</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1825910">
<exercise id="fs-id1314136">
<problem id="fs-id4315464">
<para id="fs-id2627959">Sawijining siswa nindakake panaliten lan nemokake yen cacah pangguna ponsel ing Amerika Serikat sajrone sawijining sasi ing taun <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2014</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mstyle fontweight="bold"><m:mn>327,577,529</m:mn></m:mstyle><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Sebutake wilangan kasebut nganggo tembung.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2425040">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1526255">Temtokake periode-periode ing wilangan kasebut.<newline />
<media id="fs-id2670483" alt="Gambar kanthi telung nilai sing dipisah nganggo koma. Nilai kapisan yaiku “327” lan diwenehi label “yutanan”. Nilai kapindho yaiku “577” lan diwenehi label “éwuan”. Nilai katelu yaiku “529” lan diwenehi label “satuan”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_015_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id2263806">Sebutake wilangan ing saben periode, banjur jeneng periodene. Wenehana koma kanggo misahake periode.</para>
<para id="fs-id1738516">Periode yutanan: telung atus pitulikur yuta</para>
<para id="fs-id1409152">Periode éwuan: limang atus pitung puluh pitu éwu</para>
<para id="fs-id1344528">Periode satuan: limang atus sangalikur</para><para id="fs-id1394436">Dadi, cacah pangguna ponsel ing Amerika Serikat ing sasi April yaiku telung atus pitulikur yuta, limang atus pitung puluh pitu éwu, limang atus sangalikur.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1628781" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2472209">
<problem id="fs-id2223828">
<para id="fs-id1919954">Cacah jiwa ing sawijining negara yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>316,128,839</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Sebutake wilangan kasebut.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1393924">
<para id="fs-id2243722">telung atus nembelas yuta, satus wolulikur éwu, wolung atus telung puluh sanga</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1808812" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2060477">
<problem id="fs-id2172100">
<para id="fs-id1250766">Sataun yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>31,536,000</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> detik. Sebutake wilangan kasebut.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1360632">
<para id="fs-id1269733">telung puluh siji yuta, limang atus telung puluh enem éwu</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section><section id="fs-id1339359" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Nggunakake Nilai Panggonan kanggo Nulis Wilangan Cacah</title>
<para id="fs-id2607182">Saiki proses kasebut bakal dibalik: wilangan sing diwenehake nganggo tembung bakal ditulis nganggo digit.</para>
<note id="fs-id2398163" class="howto"><title>Nggunakake nilai panggonan kanggo nulis wilangan cacah.</title><list id="eip-100" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Temtokake tembung-tembung sing nuduhake periode. (Elinga yen jeneng periode satuan ora tau disebutake.)</item>
<item>Gawea telung panggonan kosong kanggo nuduhake cacah panggonan sing dibutuhake ing saben periode. Pisahna periode nganggo koma.</item>
<item>Sebutake wilangan ing saben periode lan pasang digit ing posisi nilai panggonan sing bener.</item></list>


</note><example id="fs-id2376697"><exercise id="fs-id1340436"><problem id="fs-id845531">
<para id="fs-id1576302">Tulisen wilangan-wilangan ing ngisor iki nganggo digit.</para>
<list id="fs-id2264653" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> sèket telu yuta, patang atus siji éwu, pitung atus patang puluh loro</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> sangang milyar, rong atus patang puluh enem yuta, pitung puluh telu éwu, satus wolung puluh sanga</item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1786412">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id3402446"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Temtokake tembung-tembung sing nuduhake periode.</para><para id="fs-id2198541">Kajaba periode kapisan, kabeh periode liyane kudu nduweni telung panggonan. Gambarna telung panggonan kosong kanggo nuduhake cacah panggonan sing dibutuhake ing saben periode. Pisahna periode nganggo koma.</para>
<para id="fs-id4300938">Banjur tulisen digit-digit ing saben periode.<newline />
<media id="fs-id2668978" alt="Gambar kanthi telung blok teks sing nuding menyang nilai angka. Blok teks kapisan yaiku “sèket telu yuta”, diwenehi label “yutanan”, lan nuding menyang nilai 53. Blok teks kapindho yaiku “patang atus siji éwu”, diwenehi label “éwuan”, lan nuding menyang nilai 401. Blok teks katelu yaiku “pitung atus patang puluh loro”, diwenehi label “satuan”, lan nuding menyang nilai 742.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_016_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id1726897">Gabungna digit-digit kasebut, kalebu komane. Wilangane yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>53,401,742</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1683995"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Temtokake tembung-tembung sing nuduhake periode.</para><para id="fs-id2159900">Kajaba periode kapisan, kabeh periode liyane kudu nduweni telung panggonan. Gambarna telung panggonan kosong kanggo nuduhake cacah panggonan sing dibutuhake ing saben periode. Pisahna periode nganggo koma.</para>
<para id="fs-id3429801">Banjur tulisen digit-digit ing saben periode.<newline />
<media id="fs-id2903601" alt="Gambar kanthi patang blok teks sing nuding menyang nilai angka. Blok kapisan yaiku “sangang milyar”, diwenehi label “milyar”, lan nuding menyang nilai 9. Blok kapindho yaiku “rong atus patang puluh enem yuta”, diwenehi label “yutanan”, lan nuding menyang nilai 246. Blok katelu yaiku “pitung puluh telu éwu”, diwenehi label “éwuan”, lan nuding menyang nilai 073. Blok kapapat yaiku “satus wolung puluh sanga”, diwenehi label “satuan”, lan nuding menyang nilai 189.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_017_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id1374355">Wilangan kasebut yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9,246,073,189</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id2880619">Gatekna yen ing bagean <span class="token">ⓑ</span>, nol dibutuhake minangka digit pangisi ing panggonan atusan éwu. Pesthekna yen nol ditulis nalika dibutuhake supaya saben periode, kajaba mbokmenawa periode kapisan, nduweni telung panggonan.</para></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1542693" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2646708">
<problem id="fs-id3436547">
<para id="fs-id2270159">Tulisen saben wilangan ing wujud standar:</para>
<para id="fs-id2149876">sèket telu yuta, wolung atus sanga éwu, sèket siji.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id998472">
<para id="fs-id4163187">53,809,051</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2437124" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2202956">
<problem id="fs-id1402052">
<para id="fs-id1337332">Tulisen saben wilangan ing wujud standar:</para>
<para id="fs-id1792489">rong milyar, rolikur yuta, pitung atus patbelas éwu, patang atus sewidak enem.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1330293">
<para id="fs-id1885399">2,022,714,466</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id3202693">
<exercise id="fs-id1336757">
<problem id="fs-id1917299">
<para id="fs-id2590590">Anggaran sawijining negara bagean watara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$77</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> milyar. Tulisen anggaran kasebut ing wujud standar.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1949045">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id2634266">Temtokake periodene. Ing kene, mung rong digit sing diwenehake lan loro-lorone ana ing periode milyaran. Kanggo nulis wilangan cacah kasebut, tulisen digit nol ing kabeh periode liyane.<newline />
<media id="fs-id1345376" alt="Gambar kanthi patang blok teks sing nuding menyang nilai angka. Blok kapisan isine “77 milyar”, diwenehi label “milyaran”, lan nuding menyang nilai “77”. Blok kapindho kosong, diwenehi label “yutanan”, lan nuding menyang “000”. Blok katelu kosong, diwenehi label “éwuan”, lan nuding menyang “000”. Blok kapapat kosong, diwenehi label “satuan”, lan nuding menyang “000”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_018_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id2319817">Dadi, anggaran kasebut watara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$77,000,000,000.</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1805534" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1485641">
<problem id="fs-id1929413">
<para id="fs-id2262938">Tulisen saben wilangan ing wujud standar:</para>
<para id="fs-id1800228">Jarak paling cedhak saka Bumi menyang Mars watara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>34</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta mil.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1779102">
<para id="fs-id865214">34,000,000 mil</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1397780" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2133886">
<problem id="fs-id1781552">
<para id="fs-id1515747">Tulisen saben wilangan ing wujud standar:</para>
<para id="fs-id1586764">Bobot total kapal induk yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>204</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta pound.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2262414">
<para id="fs-id1395137">204,000,000 pound</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section><section id="fs-id2472737" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Mbunderake Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id1333125">Ing taun <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2013</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Biro Sensus Amerika Serikat nglaporake yen cacah jiwa ing negara bagean New York yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19,651,127</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> jiwa. Bisa uga cukup yen disebutake cacah jiwane watara <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta jiwa. Tembung <emphasis effect="italics">watara</emphasis> ateges yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta dudu cacah jiwa sing pas, nanging cedhak karo cacah sing pas.</para>
<para id="fs-id2368933">Proses nggoleki nilai watara saka sawijining wilangan diarani <term id="term-00010">pambunderan</term>. Wilangan dibunderake menyang nilai panggonan tartamtu manut tingkat tlitine sing dibutuhake. Nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> yuta dipikolehi kanthi mbunderake menyang panggonan yutanan. Yen dibunderake menyang panggonan atusan éwu, asile yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19,700,000</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. Yen dibunderake menyang panggonan puluhan éwu, asile yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19,650,000</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>, lan sateruse. Nilai panggonan sing dituju ing pambunderan gumantung marang carane wilangan kasebut bakal digunakake.</para><para id="fs-id2132131">Garis wilangan bisa mbantu nggambarake lan mangerteni proses pambunderan. Gatekna garis wilangan ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_019" />. Upamane kita arep mbunderake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang puluhan paling cedhak. Ing garis wilangan, apa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> luwih cedhak karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> utawa karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>?</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_019"><media id="fs-id3447999" alt="Gambar garis wilangan saka 70 nganti 80 kanthi saben langkah mundhak siji. Wilangan 70 lan 80 wernane abang. Ana titik sing nandhani nilai “76” ing garis wilangan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_019.jpg" />
</media>

<caption>Bisa dideleng yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> luwih cedhak karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> tinimbang karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dadi, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> sing dibunderake menyang puluhan paling cedhak dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><para id="fs-id1885331">Saiki gatekna wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Golekana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_020" />.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_020"><media id="fs-id2907091" alt="Gambar garis wilangan saka 70 nganti 80 kanthi saben langkah mundhak siji. Wilangan 70 lan 80 wernane abang. Ana titik sing nandhani nilai “72” ing garis wilangan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_020.jpg" />
</media>

<caption>Bisa dideleng yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> luwih cedhak karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> mula <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> sing dibunderake menyang puluhan paling cedhak dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><para id="fs-id2646813">Kepriye carane mbunderake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang puluhan paling cedhak? Golekana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_021" />.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_021"><media id="fs-id2471614" alt="Gambar garis wilangan saka 70 nganti 80 kanthi saben langkah mundhak siji. Wilangan 70 lan 80 wernane abang. Ana titik sing nandhani nilai “75” ing garis wilangan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_021.jpg" />
</media>

<caption>Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> dumunung pas ing tengah antarane <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><para id="fs-id1384953">Supaya kabeh wong mbunderake kanthi cara sing padha ing kahanan kaya iki, para ahli matematika sarujuk mbunderake menyang wilangan sing luwih gedhé, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dadi, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> sing dibunderake menyang puluhan paling cedhak dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1545266">Sawise ndeleng proses iki ing garis wilangan, kita bisa ngenalake prosedur sing luwih umum. Kanggo mbunderake sawijining wilangan menyang nilai panggonan tartamtu, gatekna digit sing pas ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan kasebut. Yen digit kasebut luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> bunderake mudhun. Yen digit kasebut luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> bunderake munggah.</para>
<para id="fs-id1583269">Minangka tuladha, kanggo mbunderake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang puluhan paling cedhak, kita nggatekake digit ing panggonan satuan.</para>
<media id="fs-id1318626" alt="Gambar wilangan 76. Label biru “panggonan puluhan” nuding digit 7, dene label abang “luwih gedhé tinimbang 5” nuding digit 6.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_022.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id1717390">Digit ing panggonan satuan yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Amarga <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math> luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> kita nambah siji ing digit panggonan puluhan. Dadi, <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan puluhan dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Banjur, ganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengen <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math> nganggo nol. Mula, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> dibunderake dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<media id="fs-id1233161" alt="Gambar pambunderan 76 dadi 80. Digit 6 dicoret lan diwenehi pituduh “ganti nganggo 0”, dene digit 7 diwenehi pituduh “tambahake 1”. Asil 80 ditampilake ing ngisore.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_031_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id2966405">Ayo digatekake maneh <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">pambunderan</term> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang wilangan paling cedhak sing kalebu kelipatan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Maneh, kita nggatekake panggonan satuan.</para>
<media id="fs-id2306384" alt="Gambar wilangan 72. Label biru “panggonan puluhan” nuding digit 7, dene label abang “luwih cilik tinimbang 5” nuding digit 2.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_032_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id2700449">Digit ing panggonan satuan yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Amarga <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> digit ing panggonan puluhan ora diowahi lan digit ing sisih tengene diganti nganggo nol. Dadi, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> sing dibunderake menyang puluhan paling cedhak dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<media id="fs-id2588331" alt="Gambar pambunderan 72 dadi 70. Digit 2 dicoret lan diwenehi pituduh “ganti nganggo 0”, dene digit 7 diwenehi pituduh “aja ditambahi 1”. Asil 70 ditampilake ing ngisore.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_033_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
<note id="fs-id1627986" class="howto"><title>Mbunderake wilangan cacah menyang nilai panggonan tartamtu.</title><list id="eip-id1168287215567" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Golekana nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake. Kabeh digit ing sisih kiwa nilai panggonan kasebut ora owah, kajaba yen digit ing nilai panggonan kasebut yaiku 9; ing kahanan iku digit ing sisih kiwa bisa owah. (Delengen Langkah 3.)</item>
<item>Wenehana garis ing sangisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake.</item>
<item>Temtokake apa digit iki luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>
<list id="fs-id2486248" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item>Ya—tambahake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing digit ing nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake. Yen digit kasebut 9, ganti nganggo 0 lan tambahake 1 ing digit sing pas ing sisih kiwane. Yen digit iku uga 9, baleni langkah iki.</item>
<item>Ora—aja ngowahi digit ing nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake.</item>
</list></item>
<item>Ganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake nganggo nol.</item></list></note><example id="fs-id1395272"><exercise id="fs-id3298586"><problem id="fs-id3365604">
<para id="fs-id555970">Bunderake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>843</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang puluhan paling cedhak.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1245694">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-659" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel iki dumadi saka rong kolom. Kolom kapisan menehi pituduh supaya pamaca nggoleki panggonan puluhan. Ing jejere ana wilangan 843 kanthi label “panggonan puluhan” sing nuding digit 4. Larik sabanjure menehi pituduh supaya digit ing sisih tengen panggonan puluhan diwenehi garis ing sangisore, banjur ana wilangan 843 kanthi digit 3 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen amarga 3 luwih cilik tinimbang 5, digit ing panggonan puluhan ora diowahi, banjur ana wilangan 843 kanthi digit 3 sing isih diwenehi garis ing sangisore. Larik sabanjure menehi pituduh supaya kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan puluhan diganti nganggo nol, banjur ana wilangan 840 kanthi digit 0 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 843 sing dibunderake menyang puluhan paling cedhak dadi 840."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Golekana panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287213054" alt="Wilangan 843 kanthi label “panggonan puluhan” sing nuding digit 4.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_034_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Wenehana garis ing sangisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288706202" alt="Wilangan 843 kanthi digit 3 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_034_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Amarga 3 luwih cilik tinimbang 5, aja ngowahi digit ing panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288469372" alt="Wilangan 843 kanthi digit 3 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_034_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Ganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan puluhan nganggo nol.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288213158" alt="Wilangan 840 kanthi digit 0 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_034_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
     <entry />
     <entry>Pambunderan 843 menyang puluhan paling cedhak ngasilake 840.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>







</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2324035" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1312230">
<problem id="fs-id1361993">
<para id="fs-id1347444">Bunderake menyang puluhan paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>157</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2458753">
<para id="fs-id1178888">160</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2306340" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2648829">
<problem id="fs-id1732081">
<para id="fs-id2210570">Bunderake menyang puluhan paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>884</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1822077">
<para id="fs-id1269556">880</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id3407439"><exercise id="fs-id1788778"><problem id="fs-id2351315">
<para id="fs-id1339512">Bunderake saben wilangan menyang atusan paling cedhak:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168287209769" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>23,658</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>3,978</m:mn></m:math></item></list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1352043">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>

 <table id="eip-493" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Panyelesaian bagean a. Tabel iki dumadi saka rong kolom: kolom kiwa ngemot pituduh lan kolom tengen nampilake wilangan. Larik kapisan menehi pituduh supaya pamaca nggoleki panggonan atusan, banjur ana wilangan 23,658 kanthi label “panggonan atusan” sing nuding digit 6. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan yaiku 5 lan kudu diwenehi garis ing sangisore, banjur ana wilangan 23,658 kanthi digit 5 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen amarga 5 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, pambunderan ditindakake munggah kanthi nambahake 1 ing digit panggonan atusan, banjur kabeh digit ing sisih tengene diganti nganggo nol. Ing jejere ana wilangan 23,658 kanthi label “tambahake 1” sing nuding digit 6 lan label “ganti nganggo nol” sing nuding digit 5 lan 8; panah tumuju asil 23,700. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 23,658 sing dibunderake menyang atusan paling cedhak dadi 23,700."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
<row><entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry><entry /></row>
  <row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Golekana panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288300776" alt="Panah nuding saka 'panggonan atusan' menyang digit 6 ing wilangan 23,658, kanggo nggambarake konsep nilai panggonan."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_035_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan yaiku 5. Wenehana garis ing sangisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288227113" alt="Wilangan 23,658 ditulis kanthi garis mendatar ing sangisore digit 5."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_035_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Amarga 5 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, bunderake munggah kanthi nambahake 1 ing digit panggonan atusan. Banjur ganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan nganggo nol.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287065587" alt="Wilangan 23,658 ditampilake kanthi panah sing nuding digit 6 lan pituduh kanggo nambahake 1, uga panah sing nuding digit 5 lan 8 kanthi pituduh kanggo ngganti loro digit kasebut nganggo nol. Asile yaiku 23,700."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_035_img-02.png.id-ID.svg" /></media><newline />Dadi, 23,658 sing dibunderake menyang atusan paling cedhak yaiku 23,700.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>





</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-379" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Panyelesaian bagean b. Tabel iki dumadi saka rong kolom: kolom kiwa ngemot pituduh lan kolom tengen nampilake wilangan. Larik kapisan menehi pituduh supaya pamaca nggoleki panggonan atusan, banjur ana wilangan 3,978 kanthi label “panggonan atusan” sing nuding digit 9. Larik sabanjure menehi pituduh supaya digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan diwenehi garis ing sangisore, banjur ana wilangan 3,978 kanthi digit 7 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan yaiku 7. Amarga 7 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, tambahake 1 ing digit 9, tulisen 0 ing panggonan atusan, tambahake 1 ing panggonan éwuan, banjur ganti digit 7 lan 8 nganggo nol. Panah tumuju asil 4,000. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 3,978 sing dibunderake menyang atusan paling cedhak dadi 4,000."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry><entry /></row><row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Golekana panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289428642" alt="Panah nuding '9' ing wilangan 3,978, kanthi tulisan 'panggonan atusan' ing ndhuwure, kanggo nggambarake digit atusan ing wilangan patang digit."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_036_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Wenehana garis ing sangisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286086719" alt="Wilangan 3,978 ditulis kanthi garis mendatar ing sangisore digit 7."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_036_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan yaiku 7. Amarga 7 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, bunderake munggah kanthi nambahake 1 ing 9. Banjur ganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan atusan nganggo nol.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289428689" alt="Ilustrasi pambunderan 3,978 menyang atusan paling cedhak. Digit atusan 9 ditambahi 1 dadi 10; digit 0 ditulis ing panggonan atusan, 1 ditambahake ing digit 3 ing panggonan éwuan, lan digit liyane diganti nganggo nol. Asile yaiku 4,000."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_036_img-02.png.id-ID.svg" /></media><newline />Dadi, 3,978 sing dibunderake menyang atusan paling cedhak yaiku 4,000.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1518702" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1288049">
<problem id="fs-id1512227">
<para id="fs-id2133764">Bunderake menyang atusan paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17,852</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2877246">
<para id="fs-id1336744">17,900</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2149604" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1153191">
<problem id="fs-id1792323">
<para id="fs-id1939348">Bunderake menyang atusan paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4,951</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1461584">
<para id="fs-id1344986">5,000</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1263758"><exercise id="fs-id1951300"><problem id="fs-id1471031">
<para id="fs-id2283895">Bunderake saben wilangan menyang éwuan paling cedhak:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168289456047" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>147,032</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>29,504</m:mn></m:math></item>
</list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1559025">
<title>Panyelesaian</title><table id="eip-695" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel iki dumadi saka rong kolom: kolom kiwa ngemot pituduh lan kolom tengen nampilake wilangan. Larik kapisan nampilake wilangan 147,032 kanthi label “panggonan éwuan” sing nuding digit 7, uga pituduh supaya digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan diwenehi garis ing sangisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan yaiku 0. Amarga 0 luwih cilik tinimbang 5, digit ing panggonan éwuan ora diowahi; ing jejere ana wilangan 147,032 kanthi digit 0 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore. Larik sabanjure menehi pituduh supaya pamaca ngganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan nganggo nol, banjur ana wilangan 147,000. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 147,032 sing dibunderake menyang éwuan paling cedhak dadi 147,000."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry><entry /></row><row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Golekana panggonan éwuan. Wenehana garis ing sangisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168285947958" alt="Wilangan 147,032 ditampilake kanthi panah sing nuding digit 7 lan label sing nerangake yen digit kasebut ana ing panggonan éwuan."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_037_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan yaiku 0. Amarga 0 luwih cilik tinimbang 5, digit ing panggonan éwuan ora diowahi.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168285947976" alt="Wilangan 147,032 ditampilake kanthi digit 0 ing panggonan atusan sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_037_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Banjur, kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan diganti nganggo nol.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286217819" alt="Wilangan 147,000 ditampilake minangka asil pambunderan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_037_img-03.png" /></media><newline />Dadi, 147,032 sing dibunderake menyang éwuan paling cedhak yaiku 147,000.</entry>
  </row>

</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-596" class="unnumbered unstyled has-images" aria-label="Tabel iki dumadi saka rong kolom: kolom kiwa ngemot pituduh lan kolom tengen nampilake wilangan. Larik kapisan menehi pituduh supaya pamaca nggoleki panggonan éwuan, banjur ana wilangan 29,504 kanthi label “panggonan éwuan” sing nuding digit 9. Larik sabanjure menehi pituduh supaya digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan diwenehi garis ing sangisore, banjur ana wilangan 29,504 kanthi digit 5 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore. Larik sabanjure nerangake yen digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan yaiku 5. Amarga 5 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, tambahake 1 ing digit 9, tulisen 0 ing panggonan éwuan, tambahake 1 ing panggonan puluhan éwu, banjur ganti telung digit pungkasan nganggo nol. Panah tumuju asil 30,000. Larik pungkasan nerangake yen 29,504 sing dibunderake menyang éwuan paling cedhak dadi 30,000."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry><entry /></row><row>
    <entry valign="bottom">Golekana panggonan éwuan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287387756" alt="Wilangan 29,504 ditampilake kanthi panah sing nuding digit 9 lan label sing nerangake yen digit kasebut ana ing panggonan éwuan."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_038_img-01.png.id-ID.svg" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Wenehana garis ing sangisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168284799982" alt="Wilangan 29,504 ditampilake kanthi digit 5 sing diwenehi garis ing sangisore."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_038_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan yaiku 5. Amarga 5 luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5, bunderake munggah kanthi nambahake 1 ing 9. Banjur ganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengen panggonan éwuan nganggo nol.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288313851" alt="Gambar pambunderan 29,504 menyang éwuan paling cedhak. Siji ditambahake ing digit 9 ing panggonan éwuan dadi 10; 0 ditulis ing panggonan éwuan, 1 ditambahake ing panggonan puluhan éwu, lan telung digit pungkasan diganti nganggo nol. Asile yaiku 30,000."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_038_img-03.png.id-ID.svg" /></media><newline />Dadi, 29,504 sing dibunderake menyang éwuan paling cedhak yaiku 30,000.</entry></row>

</tbody>








</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1751923">Gatekna yen ing bagean <span class="token">ⓑ</span>, nalika kita nambahake <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> éwu ing <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math> éwu, gunggunge dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> éwu. Iki diklompokake maneh dadi <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> klompok sepuluh éwu lan <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> éwu. Kita nambahake <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> klompok sepuluh éwu kasebut ing <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> klompok sepuluh éwu, banjur nulis <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan éwuan.</para></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2603401" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id3447872">
<problem id="fs-id2168214">
<para id="fs-id1756663">Bunderake menyang éwuan paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>63,921</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2947129">
<para id="fs-id1823220">64,000</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id4211785" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1371038">
<problem id="fs-id2279344">
<para id="fs-id2276491">Bunderake menyang éwuan paling cedhak: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>156,437</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1251048">
<para id="fs-id2174049">156,000</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id3323694" class="media-2"><title>AKSES SUMBER PASINAON DARING TAMBAHAN</title><list id="fs-id1881276" display="block">
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24detplaceval">Temtokake Nilai Panggonan</link></item>
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24numdigword">Nulis Wilangan Cacah nganggo Digit saka Tembung</link></item>
</list>
</note></section><section id="fs-id2296006" class="key-concepts" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Konsep Pokok</title><figure id="eip-id1170196618448"><media id="eip-id1170196618449" alt="Bagan kanthi irah-irahan 'Nilai Panggonan' ngemot limalas kolom lan 4 baris. Kolom-kolom kasebut dipérang dadi limang klompok, saben klompok ngemot telung kolom. Baris irah-irahan nuduhake Trilyun, Milyar, Yuta, Éwuan, lan Satuan. Baris sabanjure ngemot 'Atusan trilyun', 'Sepuluh trilyun', 'trilyun', 'satus milyar', 'sepuluh milyar', 'milyar', 'satus yuta', 'sepuluh yuta', 'yutanan', 'satus éwu', 'sepuluh éwu', 'éwuan', 'atusan', 'puluhan', lan 'satuan'. Ing baris sabanjure, 8 kolom sing wiwitan kosong. Wiwit kolom kasanga, nilaine yaiku '5', '2', '7', '8', '1', '9', lan '4'.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_011.png.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><list id="eip-903"><item><emphasis>Sebutna wilangan cacah nganggo tembung.</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170195386307" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Wiwit digit paling kiwa, sebutna wilangan ing saben periode, banjur sebutna jeneng periodene. Jeneng periode satuan ora perlu disebut.</item>
<item>Gunakna tandha koma ing panulisan wilangan kanggo misahake saben periode.</item></list></item>
<item><emphasis>Gunakna nilai panggonan kanggo nulis wilangan cacah.</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170195386319" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Kenalina tembung-tembung sing nuduhake periode. (Elinga yen periode satuan ora tau disebut.)</item>
<item>Gawea telung panggonan kosong kanggo nuduhake cacah panggonan digit sing dibutuhake ing saben periode.</item>
<item>Sebutna wilangan ing saben periode, banjur selehna digit-digit kasebut ing posisi nilai panggonan sing bener.</item></list></item>

<item><emphasis>Mbunderake wilangan cacah menyang nilai panggonan tartamtu.</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170195386333" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Golekana nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake. Kabeh digit ing sisih kiwa nilai panggonan kasebut tetep, kajaba yen digit ing nilai panggonan kasebut 9; ing kahanan iki, digit ing sisih kiwane bisa owah. (Delengen Langkah 3.)</item>
<item>Wenehana garis ing sangisore digit sing pas ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake.</item>
<item>Temtokna apa digit iki luwih gedhé tinimbang utawa padha karo 5. Yen iya, tambahna 1 ing digit ing nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake. Yen digit kasebut 9, gantinen nganggo 0 lan tambahna 1 ing digit sing pas ing sisih kiwane. Yen digit kasebut uga 9, balenana langkah iki. Yen ora, aja ngowahi digit ing nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake.</item>
<item>Ganti kabeh digit ing sisih tengen nilai panggonan sing ditemtokake nganggo nol.</item></list></item>
</list></section><section id="fs-id2279009" class="section-exercises" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<section id="fs-id2318815" class="practice-perfect">
<title>Latihan supaya Saya Trampil</title>
<para id="fs-id2686876"><emphasis effect="bold">Ngenali Wilangan Asli lan Wilangan Cacah</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-498">Ing latihan ing ngisor iki, temtokake wilangan endi sing kalebu <span class="token">ⓐ</span> wilangan asli lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wilangan cacah.</para><exercise id="fs-id1617693"><problem id="fs-id2475713">
<para id="fs-id1029877"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>8.1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>125</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2686692">
<list id="fs-id1933041" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 5, 125</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 5, 125</item></list></solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id834824">
<problem id="fs-id1566499">
<para id="fs-id1321421"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>20.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>300</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2925019"><problem id="fs-id2186619">
<para id="fs-id1717367"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3.9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>50</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>221</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1932107">
<list id="fs-id2278021" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 50, 221</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0, 50, 221</item></list>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2134956">
<problem id="fs-id1367088">
<para id="fs-id2452665"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>303</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>422.6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2960237"><emphasis effect="bold">Model Wilangan Cacah</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-954">Ing latihan ing ngisor iki, gunakna notasi nilai panggonan kanggo nemtokake nilai wilangan sing dimodelake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>.</para><exercise id="fs-id1224988"><problem id="fs-id2437093">
<media id="fs-id1393361" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing dumadi saka limang persegi atusan, nem batang puluhan, lan siji blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_201_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1385187">
<para id="fs-id2590572">561</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2646862"><problem id="fs-id2805128">
<media id="fs-id1284927" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing dumadi saka telung persegi atusan, wolung batang puluhan, lan papat blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_202_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1462995"><problem id="fs-id2946657">
<media id="fs-id2675330" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing dumadi saka patang persegi atusan lan pitu blok satuan; ora ana batang puluhan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_203_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2669520">
<para id="fs-id1988320">407</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1339977"><problem id="fs-id1577980">
<media id="fs-id2716627" alt="Gambar blok basis-10 sing dumadi saka nem persegi atusan lan rong batang puluhan; ora ana blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_204_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise><para id="fs-id1362956"><emphasis effect="bold">Ngenali Nilai Panggonan Sawijining Digit</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-439">Ing latihan ing ngisor iki, temtokake nilai panggonan saben digit sing diwenehake.</para><exercise id="fs-id2466117"><problem id="fs-id1238472">
<para id="fs-id2375962"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>579,601</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<list id="eip-id1168289429789" class="circled" list-type="enumerated" number-style="lower-alpha"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 9</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 6</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> 0</item>
