<exercise id="fs-id1294881">
<problem id="fs-id1744657">
<para id="fs-id2692049"><emphasis effect="bold">Nulis Cek</emphasis> Jorge tuku mobil kanthi rega <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$24,493</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dheweke mbayar mobil kasebut nganggo cek. Tulisen rega tuku kasebut nganggo tembung.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id764785">
<para id="fs-id2587177">Patlikur éwu, patang atus sangang puluh telu dolar</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2610406">
<problem id="fs-id1899511">
<para id="fs-id2390911"><emphasis effect="bold">Nulis Cek</emphasis> Beya renovasi pawone Marissa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$18,549</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dheweke nulis cek kanggo kontraktor. Tulisen gunggung dhuwit sing dibayar nganggo tembung.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2792494"><problem id="fs-id1816472">
<para id="fs-id1317952"><emphasis effect="bold">Tuku Mobil</emphasis> Jorge tuku mobil kanthi rega <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$24,493</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Bunderake rega kasebut menyang nilai paling cedhak ing ngisor iki:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168288191463" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> sepuluh dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> satus dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> sèwu dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> sepuluh éwu dolar</item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1154314">
<list id="eip-id1168288210369" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> $24,490</item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> $24,500 </item><item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> $24,000 </item><item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> $20,000</item></list></solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1604312"><problem id="fs-id1166211">
<para id="fs-id1932966"><emphasis effect="bold">Renovasi Pawon</emphasis> Beya renovasi pawone Marissa yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$18,549</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Bunderake beya kasebut menyang nilai paling cedhak ing ngisor iki:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168287387980" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> sepuluh dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> satus dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> sèwu dolar</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> sepuluh éwu dolar</item></list></problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2609369"><problem id="fs-id2058233">
<para id="fs-id4171773"><emphasis effect="bold">Populasi</emphasis> Populasi Tiongkok yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1,355,692,544</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2014</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Bunderake populasi kasebut menyang nilai paling cedhak ing ngisor iki:</para><list id="eip-id1168289677973" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> siji milyar wong</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> satus yuta wong</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> siji yuta wong</item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1177141"><list id="eip-id1168289677990" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1,000,000,000</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1,400,000,000</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mn>1,356,000,000</m:mn></m:math></item></list></solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1806959"><problem id="fs-id1792359">
<para id="fs-id1270274"><emphasis effect="bold">Astronomi</emphasis> Jarak rata-rata antarane bumi lan srengenge yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>149,597,888</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kilometer. Bunderake jarak kasebut menyang nilai paling cedhak ing ngisor iki:</para><list id="eip-id1168288211528" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> satus yuta kilometer</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> sepuluh yuta kilometer</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> siji yuta kilometer</item></list></problem>
</exercise></section>
<section id="fs-id1345943" class="writing">
<title>Latihan Nulis</title>
<exercise id="fs-id3202450">
<problem id="fs-id2410682">
<para id="fs-id1946666">Nganggo tembungmu dhewe, jlentrehake bedane wilangan asli lan wilangan cacah.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1948767">
<para id="fs-id2701563">Wangsulan bisa beda-beda. Wilangan cacah yaiku wilangan asli bebarengan karo nol.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1258379">
<problem id="fs-id4295295">
<para id="fs-id1350802">Wenehana tuladha saka urip saben dina nalika pambunderan wilangan migunani.</para>
</problem>
</exercise></section><section id="eip-823" class="self-check"><title>Priksa Pangerten Dhewe</title><para id="eip-949"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Sawise ngrampungake latihan, gunakna dhaptar priksa iki kanggo ngevaluasi sepira anggonmu nguwasani tujuan bagean iki. </para>

<figure id="eip-id1165721974706" class="unnumbered"><label /><media id="eip-id1165721974707" alt="Bagan pambiji dhiri kanggo mbiji pangerten babagan wilangan cacah, nilai panggonan, lan pambunderan. Pilihane yaiku “Yakin”, “Kanthi pitulungan”, utawa “Ora, aku durung mangerteni”."><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_AppB_001.jpg.id-ID.svg" /></media></figure>


<para id="eip-id1168469895457"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Yen tandha centhangmu sing paling akeh ana ing pilihan... </para>
<para id="eip-id1168469895465">…“Yakin”. Sugeng! Kowe wis nggayuh tujuan bagean iki. Pikirna maneh katrampilan sinau sing wis kokgunakake supaya bisa kokterusake. Apa sing wis koktindakake nganti kowe yakin bisa ngrampungake tugas-tugas iki? Wenehana wangsulan sing cetha lan mligi.</para>
<para id="eip-id1168469895472">…“Kanthi pitulungan”. Kahanan iki kudu enggal ditangani amarga topik sing durung kokkuwasani bisa ngalangi kasilmu. Ing matematika, saben topik dibangun adhedhasar materi sadurunge. Pesthekna yen dhasarmu wis kuwat sadurunge nerusake. Sapa sing bisa kokjaluki pitulungan? Kanca sakelas lan pengajar bisa dadi sumber pitulungan sing becik. Apa kampusmu nyedhiyakake layanan tutor matematika? Apa katrampilan sinaumu isih bisa ditingkatake? </para>
<para id="eip-id1168466338968">…“Ora, aku durung mangerteni”. Iki tandha pepeling sing ora kena digatekake entheng. Enggal golek pitulungan supaya kowe ora enggal kewalahan. Enggal temonana pengajar kanggo ngrembug kahananmu. Bebarengan, kowe lan pengajar bisa nyusun rencana kanggo entuk pitulungan sing dibutuhake.</para></section></section></content>
<glossary xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<definition id="fs-id2642858">
<term>koordinat</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2145854">Wilangan sing dipasangake karo sawijining titik ing garis wilangan diarani koordinat titik kasebut.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id2935860">
<term>wilangan asli</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2567732">Wilangan asli yaiku wilangan 1, 2, 3,…. </meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id2711214">
<term>garis wilangan</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2443061">Garis wilangan digunakake kanggo nggambarake wilangan. Wilangan ing garis wilangan saya gedhé saka kiwa menyang tengen lan saya cilik saka tengen menyang kiwa.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id3330600">
<term>titik asal</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2284600">Titik asal yaiku titik kanthi label 0 ing garis wilangan.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id1336470">
<term>sistem nilai panggonan</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2263265">Sistem wilangan kita diarani sistem nilai panggonan amarga nilai sawijining digit gumantung marang posisi, utawa panggonan, digit kasebut ing sawijining wilangan.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id2263270">
<term>pambunderan</term>
<meaning id="fs-id2326485">Proses nemtokake nilai watara sawijining wilangan diarani pambunderan.</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-id4338000">
<term>wilangan cacah</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1934263">Wilangan cacah yaiku wilangan 0, 1, 2, 3, ….</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary></document>
